WEBVTT

7.1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.200
When we place an order with you, it appears under Orders.

7.2
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:10.283
Like requests, orders sit in buckets: New, Processing and Ready.

7.3
00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:12.933
Open the Riverbend order.

7.4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:20.200
Additional details is your delivery brief: the customer, the address, who to contact, and any site notes.

7.5
00:00:20.633 --> 00:00:25.383
Quantities, sizes and prices are set by us, so they're read only.

7.6
00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:33.017
First, press Acknowledge Received, then confirm. That tells us you've got it, and the order moves to Processing.

7.7
00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:40.067
As things change, update each line. Pick a new status, add a note if it helps, and press Save status.

7.8
00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:50.117
Your changes wait at the bottom until you press Save status changes. We get them all in one update.

7.9
00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:55.867
When everything's ready, press Mark as Ready, then tap again to confirm the date.

7.10
00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:03.100
Need a different quantity or date, or can't fulfil the order? Send us a message in chat, and we'll update it.

7.11
00:01:03.967 --> 00:01:08.042
Any changes we make are listed in the order's Change log.

7.12
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:18.725
Prefer paper in the yard? Press Print on any order for a pick sheet. Every plant is listed with Ready and Need to Order boxes to tick, and space for notes.
